    <string name="conv_proposal_header_alpha_percent">%1$d%% opacity</string>
    <string name="conv_proposal_header_alpha_scope">100% preserves the current layout. Below 100%, one wallpaper continues behind the header and messages. Opacity may increase, up to 100%, and title/icons/plain status use theme contrast colours to keep a worst-case 4.5:1 check. Saved colours stay unchanged. Opaque status pills keep their own contrast checks. Preview uses the current theme pattern, not a personal photo. Device rendering is unverified.</string>
